 the disadvantages of  using abstract classes few of the  disadvantages of using an abstract class  in Java are abstraction is expensive as  sometimes you need to handle cases and  situations which are not necessary  followed by that the second disadvantage  is  object-relational impedance must match  in the case of our DBMS and the last  disadvantage is object relational  mapping in case of frameworks like  hibernate so these are the few important  disadvantages of using abstract classes  in Java that you need to consider before  using them into your project now with  this we have come to an end of this  session on abstract classes in Java  I hope this session was helpful if you  have any queries based on the abstract  classes in Java or any questions related  to the java programming language then  please feel free to drop them down in  the comment section below and we will  have your questions answered by our  experts as soon as possible  it's robby signing off and don't forget  to get subscribe to our channel and hit  the ville icon to receive important  updates on the trending technologies  thank you until next time  hi there if you liked this video  subscribe to the simple learn youtube  channel and click here to watch similar  videos to nerd up and get certified  click here

